					description: "The 6 is the most relationship-oriented of the single-digit numbers, organized around a genuine drive to care for those within its sphere. Its instinct is to tend: to notice when someone needs support and to provide it in ways that are practical and consistent rather than occasional and showy. This quality is not merely sentiment; the 6 experiences the wellbeing of others as intimately connected to its own wellbeing, which gives its caregiving a depth of investment that others rarely match. The 6 is also the most aesthetically attuned of all single-digit numbers, drawn to beauty, harmony, and the creation of environments where people feel at ease. Across numerology traditions, this number is regarded as the most harmonious of the nine: at its best it embodies the mature expression of love as active responsibility rather than passive feeling. Its challenge is learning that care without boundaries depletes rather than sustains.",
