					career: "The 6 is most effective in roles where its capacity for care and its aesthetic sensibility can both find expression. Healthcare, counseling, teaching, social work, and community organizing fit this number naturally. Its eye for beauty and harmony also serves it in interior design, hospitality, and the arts. The 6 is most fulfilled when it can see a direct connection between its daily work and the wellbeing of the people or environments it serves.",
					relationships: "The 6 is a devoted and attentive partner who brings warmth, stability, and genuine investment to its closest relationships. Its love is expressed through consistent action rather than declaration. The risk is a tendency to over-function for others while under-attending to its own needs, creating an imbalance that strains the relationship over time. The most successful partnerships for the 6 are those in which mutual care flows in both directions and honesty is valued above surface harmony.",
					spirituality: "The spiritual life of the 6 is inseparable from its relational life. It finds the sacred in acts of genuine service, in the beauty of natural and created environments, and in the experience of being genuinely connected to another person. Its spiritual lesson is that real service is sustainable only when the 6 first acknowledges its own needs as legitimate. The practice of receiving care with the same openness it extends to others is a significant developmental threshold for this number.",
