			health: "Health is being neglected under an impossibly busy schedule, and the constant juggling is taking a physical toll through stress, poor sleep, or skipped meals. The reversed Two of Pentacles warns the body is paying for the overload. Something must be set down to preserve wellbeing. Reassess what is truly essential and protect the basic conditions the body needs to function.",
			spirituality: "Practice has been abandoned to the chaos of daily life, leaving you ungrounded and pulled in every direction at once. The reversed Two of Pentacles points to a lost centre. Even a few minutes of daily practice can begin to restore the balance, but the deeper fix is releasing the overcommitment that crowded it out. Reclaim the still point before the scattering becomes the default.",
