				gateName: "Ordering",
				gateDescription: "Sacral energy for starting something new and forcing it into order. The impulse is mutative and arrives in pulses, so stalling before the breakthrough is part of the natural rhythm here.",
				lineMeaning: "Confusion is broadcast outward, and it summons guides who are no less confused. Growth arrives anyway, but only after the borrowed authority has been taken on and then thrown off.",
				planetDescription: "Always the wheel-opposite of the Sun, so it is derived rather than observed. It grounds whatever the Sun expresses, and the two Suns plus the two Earths fix the four gates of the incarnation cross.",
