				lineMeaning: "Beginnings that need other people to carry them. The network supplies the momentum, and the wish to be included pulls this line into starts that were never its own.",
				planetDescription: "The fastest body on the wheel, crossing it in about 28 days. It carries drive and the ongoing motion of the form, and it sets the timing for Lunar authority, which needs a full cycle before clarity arrives.",
