				gateName: "Principles",
				gateDescription: "Emotional sensitivity to whether a principle is being honored. Where it is not, this gate rejects and moves toward revolution, and where it is, it accepts and provides.",
				lineMeaning: "Rejection, then revolution, then acceptance. Change is reviewed and expanded rather than repeated, and the wisdom is knowing which principles were worth the upheaval.",
				planetDescription: "Geometry rather than personality. It marks the direction life turns toward in the second half, after the midlife transition, and on the Design side it names the environment in which the form is seen correctly.",
