				gateName: "Formulization",
				gateDescription: "Mental energy for answering. It converts the doubt pressed down by gate 63 into a possible formula, and that answer stays a hypothesis awaiting proof rather than a verified fact.",
				lineMeaning: "A mind that has seen how cheap answers are and stops offering them. Restraint is learned late, after living has been chosen over formulating, and the cost of that choice is paid without complaint.",
				planetDescription: "The familiar geometry of the first half of life, the ground the person operates from before the midlife turn. On the Design side it names the environment the body already knows and returns to by default.",
