				lineMeaning: "Others expect the depth here to be put to work, and the design is to act on it. Planning endlessly, out of insecurity about whether the depth is sufficient, is how the moment passes.",
				planetDescription: "The communication imprint. The Personality Mercury gate is the message the person is here to deliver, the Design Mercury gate is how that expression actually sounds to everyone else.",
