				gateName: "Fixed Rhythms",
				gateDescription: "Sacral energy locked to routine and timing. Habits around sleep, food, and work settle into a fixed pattern, and any interruption to that pattern is felt in the body.",
				lineMeaning: "Whatever the rhythm currently is, it is felt to be the wrong one. Imagining the other tempo rather than lurching into it is what keeps the trial and error from turning compulsive.",
				planetDescription: "Values and the moral floor under behavior. Personality Venus is what is consciously held dear, Design Venus is the standard the body applies without ever being consulted.",
