				lineMeaning: "A lifetime of hearing everything, then hearing selectively. Intuition is curbed to the moment that matters, and the rest of the noise is allowed to remain noise.",
				planetDescription: "Immature energy: raw drive that has not yet learned its own timing. It shows where action gets forced before it is ripe, and it only matures when strategy and authority are running the decision.",
