				lineMeaning: "A natural instinct to walk straight at the obstacle and provoke by direct contact. What checks it is a reluctance to strike in exactly the moment that calls for a head-on move.",
				planetDescription: "Expansion, and the law that rewards living correctly. Personality Jupiter marks where growth and abundance gather, Design Jupiter marks the protection the form receives while it stays aligned.",
