				lineMeaning: "Others draw on this vitality without asking. The practical instinct is to defend the energy against temptation, because joy spent on demand stops being joy.",
				planetDescription: "Discipline through restriction, the corrective imprint. It is where consequences arrive when the design is not honored, and its returns near ages 29 and 58 are when that account gets settled.",
