				lineMeaning: "Society projects onto this behavior and finds it either thrilling or dangerous. Principled conduct that challenges a tradition can convert the crowd, and it can also be made to answer for it.",
				planetDescription: "The unusual and the abrupt. It carries individuality and unexpected change, and its opposition near age 40 is the midlife pressure to live as oneself instead of as the conditioning.",
