				layerDescription: "The body-side half of Variable, covering the Determination and Environment arrows. It addresses the form: the conditions under which the vehicle digests nourishment, and the place in which it meets least resistance.",
				colorMeaning: "Appetite. The most primitive intake. The body wants what it wants and takes it in plainly, one simple thing at a time, and it loses the signal when ingredients and flavors are mixed together.",
				toneMeaning: "Meditation. Clarity comes from stillness and from sustained focus on one thing. Awareness settles inward, waits, and lets an impression form rather than reaching out for it.",
