						long: "The semi-sextile is a minor aspect of 30 degrees connecting adjacent signs. It creates a subtle, sometimes irritating awareness between planets that encourages small but meaningful adjustments and growth. Because adjacent signs share neither element nor modality, the semi-sextile asks us to integrate energies that do not naturally understand each other. While easy to overlook, this aspect quietly nudges personal development by highlighting blind spots and encouraging flexibility. It is often described as a background tension that, once acknowledged, becomes a source of gradual but steady self-improvement.",
